rriving exponentially at a mean of 8.0 hours, each order fixed at 2890208.0 units. Delivery to that customer takes between 1.0 hour and 2.0 hours, the selling price is $1344.62 per unit, payment comes exactly 63.0 hours later, and if stock is short, available units ship immediately while the remainder is backordered. Dell Technologies orders EV_battery on a schedule ranging from 17.0 hours to 36.0 hours, with order sizes between 1737401.0 units and 2736435.0 units. Its customer lead time runs from 13.0 hours to 28.0 hours, the sales price is $4160.025 per unit, payment arrives between 14.0 hours and 62.0 hours, and any unmet demand is fully backordered. Overall, the model includes Process Go., Memory Star, NanoMaterials Inc., FastChip Corp., and ElectroParts connected to the Integration Center, alongside the Integration Center, Main Factory, and Storage Facility, and it runs over a 730 hour horizon with 10 replications.

