able units ship immediately while the remainder waits for replenishment. Laptops are sold at $2805.439 per unit, and ABB Industrial pays 31 days after delivery. The modeled flow is straightforward: gold_wire, carbon_fiber, and lithium_cell move from their respective suppliers into the Processing Unit, laptops are produced there, and the finished product is transferred to the Distribution Center. The scenario is evaluated over a 500-week horizon with 5 replications.

