y 20.0 weeks, with demand anywhere from 375516.0 to 3078910.0 units, expects delivery in exactly 7.0 weeks, pays $3732.914 per unit, and settles invoices after 75.0 days; here, unmet demand is simply lost. The model runs in weeks over a 100-week horizon, with results collected after a 50-week warm-up period.

